              "text": "D^2-d^2=0.80^2-0.54^2=0.3484\\ m^2\\\\; A_p=\\frac{\\pi{4(D^2-d^2)=0.7854\\times0.3484=0.274\\ m^2\\\\; G_{p,m=\\gamma_cA_p=25\\times0.274=6.85\\ kN/m"
            },
            {
              "type": "terms",
              "intro": "式中：",
              "items": [
                [
                  "A_p",
